# neuron is a control plane. It builds nothing, so there are no build artifacts
# to ignore -- almost everything here is either source or writing, and tracked.

# Secrets. Only one lives here: the GM account password for the live hand.
secrets.conf
!secrets.conf.example

# The RAM-backed temp tiers. tmp/ is a symlink to /tmp/wow-chat-neuron (the
# executable tier); tmp/shared-memory is a further symlink to
# /dev/shm/wow-chat-neuron (the artifact tier, where receipts and logs go).
# Neither survives a reboot and neither belongs in git.
tmp
tmp/

# The ALE API documentation is fetched, not authored. docs/ale/download.sh
# retrieves it; only the downloader is tracked.
docs/ale/docs/

# Editor and OS leavings
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# Credentials. One per file, mode 600. See secrets/README.md
secrets/*
!secrets/README.md

# Conversations with a model. Plain text, dated. Kept because a bad plan can
# only be debugged from what the model was told -- untracked because they grow.
logs/
